const stories={citizen:['Resolve a Mishap without leaving this career.','Political upheaval draws you into a revolution. Gain a skill at level 1 and test it against 8+: victory helps Advancement; defeat harms the next Survival check.','Work or a hobby gives you experience maintaining heavy vehicles.','Your business, employer or colony grows. Gain DM+1 to a Benefit roll.','Education 10+ offers any skill at level 1.','Your personal life changes.','You discover a secret and may profit illegally, gaining a skill or criminal Contact and a Benefit DM.','Your diligence earns DM+2 to Advancement.','Technical work develops a communications, computing, engineering or sensor skill.','An influential superior becomes an Ally and offers instruction or support.','You rise to a position of power and gain an automatic promotion.'],rogue:['Resolve a Mishap without leaving this career.','Face criminal charges yourself with Advocate 8+, or spend a Benefit roll to hire a lawyer.','Planning an ambitious heist develops a technical skill.','A crime pays off, earning DM+2 to a Benefit roll and an Enemy.','Betray another rogue for advancement, or refuse and gain an Ally.','Your personal life changes.','Months in the underworld develop a survival or combat skill.','A gang feud offers an extra Benefit roll on a successful combat or Stealth check; failure causes Injury.','Join a gambling syndicate. Stake Benefit rolls, gaining half your stake rounded up on success or losing the stake on failure.','A crime lord offers tactical instruction or advancement support.','Your legendary crime earns an automatic promotion.'],entertainer:['Resolve a Mishap without leaving this career.','A controversial exhibition tests Art or Investigate. Success raises Social Standing; failure lowers it.','Celebrity circles develop a social skill or a new Contact.','A popular work earns DM+1 to a Benefit roll.','A patron becomes an Ally and grants DM+2 to Advancement.','Your personal life changes.','Challenge a political leader and gain an Enemy. Art or Persuade 8+ develops an existing skill; failure also triggers a Mishap.','A sector tour brings 1d3 Contacts.','A stolen work draws you into the criminal underworld.','Your strange life leads to an Unusual Event.','A prestigious award earns an automatic promotion.'],noble:['Resolve a Mishap without leaving this career.','Accept a duel or lose Social Standing by refusing. Fighting develops a skill; losing also causes Injury and loss of standing.','Life as a ruler or socialite develops a useful skill.','A wealthy relative leaves a gift: DM+1 to a Benefit roll.','Political intrigue develops a skill and creates a Rival.','Your personal life changes.','Join a conspiracy and test Deception or Persuade, or refuse and gain its members as Enemies.','Your rule or family wealth earns recognition, an Enemy and DM+2 to Advancement.','High society develops a social skill and brings both an Ally and a Rival.','An influential noble becomes an Ally and offers instruction or support.','The Imperium recognises your achievements with an automatic promotion.']};
const mishapStories={citizen:['An injury ends this term. Resolve the Injury table.','A criminal gang ruins your life and becomes an Enemy.','A collapse in interstellar trade costs you your job and one Social Standing.','Authorities investigate your employer or colony. Cooperate for DM+2 to your next Qualification, or refuse and gain an Ally.','Revolution or invasion forces you offworld. Streetwise 8+ allows you to improve an existing skill.','A colleague sabotages your work and becomes a Rival.'],entertainer:['You are injured. Resolve the Injury table.','A scandal ends your career. Record its circumstances in your history.','Public opinion turns against you. Lose one Social Standing.','A peer betrays you. An Ally or Contact becomes a Rival or Enemy; gain one if you have neither.','A project strands you far from home. Choose a skill developed while finding your way back.','Censorship or a dispute ends this career. Gain DM+2 to your next Qualification.'],noble:['You are injured. Resolve the Injury table.','A family scandal ends your position and costs one Social Standing.','Disaster or war threatens you. Stealth or Deception 8+ avoids an Injury.','Political manoeuvring removes you. Improve Diplomat or Advocate and gain a Rival.','An assassin attacks. Endurance 8+ avoids an Injury.','Court politics force you away. Gain a noble Contact and improve Streetwise.'],rogue:['You suffer a severe injury: take Injury result 2, or roll twice and use the lower result.','Arrest costs one Benefit roll and forces you into the Draft next term.','A friend betrays you. Convert a Contact or Ally into a Rival or Enemy, or gain a new one.','A job fails and you flee the world. Choose a skill developed during your escape.','A detective or criminal rival drives you offworld and becomes an Enemy.','You are injured. Resolve the Injury table.']};
